<text x="106.13" y="64.61" size="1.524" layer="97" font="vector" align="center">Single-cell LiPo battery</text>
<text x="7.06" y="47.25" size="3" layer="94">POWER AND FILTERING</text>
<text x="11.65" y="104.15" size="1.27" layer="97" font="vector" align="center-left">IO0: Avoid device connections. Can be used a stat LED.</text>
<text x="11.32" y="91.47" size="1.27" layer="97" font="vector" align="center-left">ADC2 is unavailable when WiFi is enabled.</text>
<text x="11.65" y="96.53" size="1.27" layer="97" font="vector" align="center-left">IO12: Avoid external pullups - will cause bootloader fail.</text>
<text x="11.75" y="106.77" size="1.27" layer="97" font="vector" align="center-left">Use boot control pins with caution: 0, 2, 5, 12, 15</text>
<text x="11.65" y="101.61" size="1.27" layer="97" font="vector" align="center-left">IO2: Avoid external pullups - will cause bootloader fail.</text>
<text x="11.65" y="93.99" size="1.27" layer="97" font="vector" align="center-left">IO15: Has builtin pullup at POR.</text>
<text x="11.65" y="99.07" size="1.27" layer="97" font="vector" align="center-left">IO5: Has builtin pullup at POR.</text>
